        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ed1c7e6-7707-48b4-a0f0-b933bc851fdb).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning agent!\r\rYour target is Craig &quot;Rocco&quot; Mcveigh. Rocco is a known slouch and is famously egocentric. His decadent lifestyle has landed him in great economical debt. His sister has through her connections in the Caruso estate landed him a job as a kitchenhand to try and turn his life around and pay of his debt. Rocco himself has no interest in his new job and continues too use his sisters good nature for economic gain. We have been hired by the sisters boyfriend to neutralize Rocco.",
